<article id="post-316" class="post-316 post type-post status-publish format-video hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-tv tag-cam-shippit tag-cse-tv tag-resaas tag-video post_format-post-format-video">
	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-tv/" rel="category tag">CSE TV</a></span>
		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/sneak-peak-new-cse-ad-bnn-featuring-resaas/" rel="bookmark">Sneak Peak &#8211; New CSE Ad on BNN Featuring RESAAS</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="post-format">
				<a class="entry-format" href="https://blog.thecse.com/type/video/">Video</a>
			</span>

			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/sneak-peak-new-cse-ad-bnn-featuring-resaas/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2014-03-07T17:39:41-05:00">March 7, 2014</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>
			
					</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p>Here is a sneak peak of the new 15-second spot that will begin airing on BNN starting March 10th:</p>
<p><span class="embed-youtube" style="text-align:center; display: block;"><iframe class="youtube-player" width="474" height="267" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/b2jysPY5ois?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent" allowfullscreen="true" style="border:0;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox"></iframe></span></p>
<p>Thank you again to RESAAS (CSE:RSS) CFO Cam Shippit for the kind words and for allowing us into their office to profile their exciting company.</p>
<div class="sharedaddy sd-sharing-enabled"><div class="robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing"><h3 class="sd-title">Share this:</h3><div class="sd-content"><ul><li class="share-email"><a rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" data-shared="sharing-email-316" class="share-email sd-button share-icon" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#" target="_blank" aria-labelledby="sharing-email-316" data-email-share-error-title="Do you have email set up?" data-email-share-error-text="If you&#039;re having problems sharing via email, you might not have email set up for your browser. You may need to create a new email yourself." data-email-share-nonce="234d088e11" data-email-share-track-url="https://blog.thecse.com/sneak-peak-new-cse-ad-bnn-featuring-resaas/?share=email">
				<span id="sharing-email-316" hidden>Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)</span>
