<article id="post-142" class="post-142 post type-post status-publish format-video hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-tv category-listed-issuers tag-bitcoin tag-danny-wettreich tag-greenbank-capital tag-kim-elton post_format-post-format-video">
	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-tv/" rel="category tag">CSE TV</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/listed-issuers/" rel="category tag">Listed Issuers</a></span>
		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/greenbank-ceo-explains-why-hes-bullish-on-bitcoins/" rel="bookmark">GreenBank CEO explains why he&#8217;s bullish on BitCoin</a></h1>
